* KiCad schematic - GaN Half-Bridge Test Circuit

* Use absolute path for the library file so ngspice can locate it regardless of CWD
.lib /home/tatsat/whb/learning/ngspice_test_setup/libs/shared_library.lib
.lib /home/tatsat/whb/learning/ngspice_test_setup/libs/active_adapter_Q1.lib
.lib /home/tatsat/whb/learning/ngspice_test_setup/libs/active_adapter_Q2.lib
.lib /home/tatsat/whb/learning/ngspice_test_setup/libs/active_adapter_Q3.lib
.lib /home/tatsat/whb/learning/ngspice_test_setup/libs/active_adapter_Q4.lib
.lib /home/tatsat/whb/learning/ngspice_test_setup/libs/active_adapter_Q5.lib
.param Temp=27

* Power Supply & DC Bus
VLS2 DC_1 0 DC 48
Lnet1 DC_1 HS 10n
C1 HS 0 100u

* High-Side Switches (3 terminals: Drain Gate Source)
XQ1 HS Q1_Gate SW_Node GAN_DEVICE_Q1
XQ2 HS Q2_Gate SW_Node GAN_DEVICE_Q2

* Low-Side Switches (3 terminals: Drain Gate Source)
XQ3 SW_Node Q3_Gate 0 GAN_DEVICE_Q3
XQ4 SW_Node Q4_Gate 0 GAN_DEVICE_Q4
XQ5 SW_Node Q5_Gate 0 GAN_DEVICE_Q5

* Gate Resistors
R1 D_HS Q1_Gate 5.1
R2 D_HS Q2_Gate 5.1
R3 D_LS Q3_Gate 10
R4 D_LS Q4_Gate 10
R5 D_LS Q5_Gate 10

* Output Filter & Load
L1 SW_Node Load 10u
C2 Load 0 100n
RLOAD Load 0 10

* Gate Driver Pulse Sources
VHS1 D_HS SW_Node PULSE(0 6 40n 2n 2n 789n 3.33u)
VLS1 D_LS 0 PULSE(0 6 873n 2n 2n 2453n 3.33u)

.options savecurrents

.end